<Enum>NR_Equalizer__MIMO_Decoder@5G Advanced Modem Enums</Enum>
<Validate><T>Int</T><D>16</D></Validate></Item>
<Item XName="MMSE_Config" Type="PartParam">
<DataEntry>0</DataEntry>
<Description>simplified mode estimates one SNR for MMSE channel estimation, but enhanced mode estimates SNR for each RBG received associated with one TX port and RX antenna. Besides, SpecifySNR allows user to specify SNR value.</Description>
<Enum>NR_PDSCH_ChannelEstimator__MMSE_Config@5G Advanced Modem Enums</Enum>
<Show><T>Bool</T><D>0</D></Show>
<Validate><T>Int</T><D>16</D></Validate></Item>
